        {
          "id": 2579932194,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "label_fill() is called at line protol.c:10850 in fill_label_float()\n\nThe buffer-overflow was happening in proto_item_fill_display_label() at line 7285, where the buffer will be 2048 bytes for a custom column, rather then 240 bytes for a regular item.\n\nI might as well do the same thing for fill_display_label_ieee_11073_float(), it looks like the only remaining case that wasn't using label_str_size...",
